    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatus: Reports the structured session status.",
    "PksSessionStatus::code: Stores the code used by `PksSessionStatus`.",
    "PksSessionStatus::detail: Stores the detail used by `PksSessionStatus`.",
    "ok: Creates a successful status value for `PksSessionStatus`.",
    "new: Creates a new `PksSessionStatus`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode: Enumerates the supported session status code cases.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::Ok: Indicates that the operation completed successfully.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::NullArgument: Identifies the null argument state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::UnsupportedAbiMajor: Identifies the unsupported ABI major state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::InvalidStructSize: Identifies the invalid struct size state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::InvalidHandle: Identifies the invalid handle state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::StaleHandle: Identifies the stale handle state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::NoCapacity: Identifies the no capacity state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::InternalPanic: Identifies the internal panic state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
    "pocketstation::abi::session::abi::PksSessionStatusCode::MisalignedPointer: Identifies the misaligned pointer state or stage represented by `PksSessionStatusCode`.",
